1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,135
Write the equilibrium constant.

2
00:00:02,135 --> 00:00:10,976
The concentration of water itself, about fifty five point five moles per litre, hardly changes, so we fold it into the constant.

3
00:00:10,976 --> 00:00:20,755
The result is the ionic product of water, K w, equal to the concentration of hydrogen ions times the concentration of hydroxide ions.

